# Rayenna Hub — Support Live Chat

**Status (2026-09-06):** Phase 2 shipped. Live Chat opens an in-Hub sheet grounded in Help Center. WhatsApp and 24/7 call remain human/emergency lanes.

## Phase 1 (keep)

- Emergency number: `CONSUMER_SUPPORT_PHONE` default **+91 7907 369 304**
- **Call Us** / emergency button → `tel:`
- If `CONSUMER_SUPPORT_BOT=0`, Live Chat falls back to WhatsApp

## Phase 2 (current)

- `POST /api/consumer/chat` (consumer JWT, 20 req / 10 min)
- RAG over Help FAQs + articles; OpenAI `gpt-4o-mini` when `OPENAI_API_KEY` is set, else top Help hit
- Safety keywords (smoke, fire, shock, exposed wiring) → emergency call CTA, no DIY
- “Talk to someone” / WhatsApp → escalate chip opens `wa.me`
- Transcripts in `consumer_chat_sessions` / `consumer_chat_messages`
- UI: `SupportChatSheet` from Support → Live Chat

